A paragraph in a held container does not loosen the item

```
- intro
  :: term
  : body

    text
.
<ul>
  <li>intro
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>
        <p>body</p>
        <p>text</p>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- :: term
  : body

    text
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>
        <p>body</p>
        <p>text</p>
      </dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- intro
  :: term
  : body

  text
.
<ul>
  <li><p>intro</p>
    <dl>
      <dt>term</dt>
      <dd>body</dd>
    </dl>
    <p>text</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```
